OL,3,GNEWSADisappointment as Youth Parliament
OL,4,Aset to be axed
OL,5,
OL,6,FScrapping the UK Youth Parliament would
OL,7,Fremove a way for young people to be
OL,8,Fheard, according to Guernsey's youngest
OL,9,Fparticipant.
OL,11,FThe parliament, which takes place at
OL,12,Fthe House of Commons, could be axed
OL,13,Fafter the UK government said it would
OL,14,Fnot commit to further grants.
OL,16,FIt was launched in 2000 to boost
OL,17,Finterest in politics among young people
OL,18,Fand has more than 300 elected members
OL,19,Faged between 11 and 18 years.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
