OL,3,GNEWSADisappointment as Youth Parliament
OL,4,Aset to be axed
OL,5,
OL,6,FCole, who was 14 years old when he
OL,7,Frepresented Guernsey last year, said it
OL,8,Ffelt "extremely disappointing that we
OL,9,Fare taking away the platform, the stage
OL,10,Fto give young people that voice".
